    "q-159750": {
      "dom_id": "step-q159750",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Let $X=[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}]^{T}$ be a bivariate normal random vector with mean vector $\\mu $ and covariance matrix $Σ$ given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mu =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,Σ=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind the distribution of $Y=-5{X}_{1}-4{X}_{2}.$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that if $X=[{X}_{1},{X}_{2}]^{T}$ is a bivariate normal random vector with mean vector $\\mu $ and covariance matrix $Σ,$ given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mu =[\\begin{aligned}{\\mu }_{1} \\\\ {\\mu }_{2}\\end{aligned}],\\,Σ=[\\begin{aligned}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2} & {\\sigma }_{12} \\\\ {\\sigma }_{21} & {\\sigma }_{2}^{2}\\end{aligned}],\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nthen the random variable $Y,$ defined as\n\n$$\nY=a{X}_{1}+b{X}_{2}\n$$\n\nis a normally distributed random variable for all values of $a$ and $b,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}E[Y] & =a{\\mu }_{1}+b{\\mu }_{2}, \\\\ Var[Y] & ={a}^{2}{\\sigma }_{1}^{2}+{b}^{2}{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}+2ab{\\sigma }_{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have ${\\mu }_{1}=1$ and ${\\mu }_{2}=-1.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[Y] & =\\text{E}[-5{X}_{1}-4{X}_{2}] \\\\  & =-5\\text{E}[{X}_{1}]-4\\text{E}[{X}_{2}] \\\\  & =-5\\cdot {\\mu }_{1}-4\\cdot {\\mu }_{2} \\\\  & =-5\\cdot 1-4\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =-5+4 \\\\  & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAlso, we have ${\\sigma }_{1}^{2}=3,{\\sigma }_{2}^{2}=2,$ and ${\\sigma }_{12}={\\sigma }_{21}=-2.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Var[Y] & =Var[-5{X}_{1}-4{X}_{2}] \\\\  & =(-5)^{2}\\cdot 3+(-4)^{2}\\cdot 2+2\\cdot (-5)\\cdot (-4)\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =75+32-80 \\\\  & =27.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\nY∼N(-1,27).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-159750-a",
